host macOS clone (Mac hand) -- Eastern (EDT) one-clock
title the Kiln through history -- the granted deep debride runs, and the stars get their full recipes
prompt kg with all recommendations granted: the deep debride and force pushes approved, every named door answered with the recommended lean. Mid-turn: fix the Dream pier's raw stream-json terminal, and make the three star launchers elder-shaped with Mind as ChatGPT on macOS and Sound as Claude Code on macOS.
think The bench drained on its own sentinel -- a keeper daemon re-touching .loop-gates-only every five seconds so every loop shell breaks at its next check, and a watcher demanding 120 unbroken quiet seconds. While it drained: the sibling's stale staged count snapshot was unstaged (the worktree already carried the true numbers), its two orphan logs carried home with index rows, and four REDS rows closed on the granted conventions -- %230 and %252 on fetch-before-book, %255 and %281 on the amend behind the empty-index check -- folding to two shelves, the pin falling from its exact bound to 12,996 bytes. The caravan choir sang all 113 rungs GREEN, the first whole sing this bench has produced.
think The debride itself ran scoped by construction: the protected set is every blob OID in HEAD's tree, so the filter's blob-callback function swaps the six word-bounded Oven forms to Kiln only in blobs reachable nowhere in the living checkout -- lineage rows, testimony still on disk, and every witness pass through byte-identical, while proven and woven never match the bound pattern. Pen-proved on a throwaway repository first; a checkpoint row and a fresh all-refs bundle landed ahead of the cut. The first foreground run died at the ten-minute tool cap with refs untouched; a substring fast-path gate before the regex brought the background rerun home in 180 seconds. HEAD's tree OID read 42bdf69a09c31a0b3a20ac1d77338c5c6e257b18 before the rewrite, after it, and after the commit-tree re-sign pass walked every commit -- three readings, one value. The rewritten pre-Kiln commit's LEXICON reads zero word-bounded Oven and eight Kiln; the counsel testimony at HEAD keeps its eight Oven exactly. Good signatures verified at HEAD and 2,000 commits deep; the spine witness GREEN; the region selftest GREEN over the rebuilt binary. The force-push of main and all six parked branches outgrew the foreground cap too and streams in the background as this log is written.
think The Dream pier's raw JSON was a paste that predates the render tail -- the launcher already pipes tee into jq with tools/s/stream_render.jq. The renderer gained two arms proven on the pier's own captured sample: a heartbeat event renders as one dot per silent half-minute, and a task_started event renders as one bracketed line. Then all three star launchers took the elder recipe's whole shape -- numbered preconditions, standing bypass, smoke test, the loop, streaming, sentinel-why, custody -- with the hosts named plainly: Mind is ChatGPT on macOS speaking the Arbor tiles, Sound is Claude Code on macOS bare in a Terminal, Dream is Claude Code in ai-jail on the pier. Each prints GREEN whole with its loop or seat line byte-verbatim.
obs Every bench that holds a clone recloneS or hard-resets after the force-push -- the one unavoidable cost the debride rule names; the pre-rewrite bundle rides in the session scratchpad and the checkpoint row names it. The loops re-paste from the new launchers when Keaton lifts them.
loom filter_runtime_s=180 protected_blobs=14559 resign_all_refs=1 tree_oid_readings=3 choir_rungs=113 pin_bytes=12996
file construction/CHECKPOINTS.md the rewrite's walk-back row, laid first
file tools/s/stream_render.jq heartbeats as dots, tasks as one line
file tools/l/launch-sound-fixed-chapter.rish elder-shaped; Claude Code on macOS named
file tools/l/launch-dream-dual-chapter.rish elder-shaped; jail preconditions carried in
file tools/l/launch-mind-cardinal-chapter.rish elder-shaped; ChatGPT on macOS named
file construction/ITINERARY.md the Kiln breach marked cut; the stars named by host
recommend check-in (Keaton) -- reclone or hard-reset every other bench, re-paste the pier and Sound loops from their launchers; the socket-table fold is the booked next lap
